# FRAMEWORK (/kreator-projektu) AI enrichment — optional.
# Without this key, /api/project-recommendation returns 503 and the wizard
# falls back to its local, rule-based recommendation. No feature is broken
# by leaving this unset.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional AI recommendation in the wizard. Leave unset (default) on static hosting such as
# Hostinger: no request to /api/project-recommendation is made and the wizard shows the local
# recommendation. Set to "true" only when building for a host that runs the endpoint above.
PUBLIC_AI_RECOMMENDATION=